---
layout: broadcast.njk
title: Home
description: Kevin Franz Jr. - 6'1" SG/SF at Shawnee Mission West. Class of 2028. College basketball + atmospheric science.
active: home
---

<section class="cg-cover">
  <div class="cg-cover-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="cg-kicker">Cover story &middot; Class of {{ player.class or "2028" }} &middot; {{ player.position or "SG/SF" }} &middot; {{ player.location }}</p>
      <h1>
        <span>Kevin</span>
        <span>Franz</span>
        <span class="cg-stroke">Junior</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="cg-dek">
        {{ player.height }} / {{ player.weight }} lb guard-forward at {{ player.highSchool }}. Pace, playmaking, and full-court defense &mdash; chasing college basketball and a degree in atmospheric science.
      </p>
      <div class="cg-cta-row">
        <a href="/basketball/" class="cg-btn">View Profile &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="cg-btn cg-btn-ghost">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="cg-cover-photo">
      <img src="/images/player/medium_Copy_of_618_A3075_2_Enhanced_NR_0a0a68195a.jpg" alt="{{ player.name }}">
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="cg-ticker">
  <div class="cg-ticker-track">
    {% set tape = "Class of " + (player.class or "2028") + "  ·  " + (player.position or "SG/SF") + "  ·  " + player.highSchool + "  ·  " + player.location + "  ·  " + player.aauTeam + "  ·  10-3  ·  8.2 PPG  ·  5.5 RPG  ·  2.8 APG  ·  GPA " + player.gpa + "  ·  " + player.gpaWeighted + " weighted  ·  JV 2025–26  5.6 PPG  ·  4.0 RPG  ·  2.5 APG  ·  2.18 AST/TO  ·  #" + player.jersey %}
    <p><span>{{ tape }}</span><span aria-hidden="true">{{ tape }}</span></p>
    <p aria-hidden="true"><span>{{ tape }}</span><span>{{ tape }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="cg-facts" aria-label="Facts">
  <div class="cg-stack">
    <article class="cg-fact">
      <p class="cg-fact-label">Measurables</p>
      <dl class="cg-metrics">
        <div><dt>HT</dt><dd>{{ player.height }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>WT</dt><dd>{{ player.weight }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>POS</dt><dd>{{ player.position }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>#</dt><dd>{{ player.jersey }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>GPA</dt><dd>{{ player.gpa }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Class</dt><dd>'{{ player.class | replace('20','') }}</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </article>
    <article class="cg-fact">
      <p class="cg-fact-label">Basketball</p>
      <h2>Guard / forward.</h2>
      <p>#{{ player.jersey or "28" }} &mdash; Pace, decisions, on-ball defense. JV 2025&ndash;26: 5.6 PPG &middot; 4.0 RPG (1st) &middot; 2.5 APG &middot; 2.18 AST/TO.</p>
      <p>{{ player.aauTeam }} &middot; 10-3 &middot; 8.2 PPG &middot; 5.5 RPG &middot; 2.8 APG.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="cg-fact">
      <p class="cg-fact-label">Academics</p>
      <h2>{{ player.gpa or "3.75" }} GPA.</h2>
      <p>{{ player.gpa or "3.75" }} GPA ({{ player.gpaWeighted or "3.82" }} weighted). Heavy load in math and science at {{ player.highSchool }}. Plan to study meteorology / atmospheric science.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="cg-fact">
      <p class="cg-fact-label">Profile</p>
      <h2>The right way.</h2>
      <p>On the floor I'm a pace-pusher and playmaker &mdash; creating for teammates, defending full court, making the right read under pressure. Off the floor I'm just as serious about the classroom, with weather and atmospheric science driving my long-term goals.</p>
      <p class="cg-quote-line">&ldquo;Help my team win. Earn the chance to play college ball.&rdquo;</p>
    </article>
    <article class="cg-fact">
      <p class="cg-fact-label">Character</p>
      <h2>Off the floor.</h2>
      <p>Weather nerd, film-room junkie, and mentor to younger players. Leadership, family, and showing up.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <figure class="cg-slot">
    <img src="/images/banner/large_Copy_of_618_A3237_2_Enhanced_NR_8707ac32b4.jpg" alt="Kevin in action">
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="cg-journey" aria-label="Journey">
  <header class="cg-band">
    <div>
      <p class="cg-kicker">Journey</p>
      <h2>Every team.</h2>
    </div>
  </header>
  {% include "journey-strip.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="cg-issue" aria-label="In this issue">
  <header class="cg-band">
    <div>
      <p class="cg-kicker">Contents</p>
      <h2>In this issue</h2>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="cg-toc">
    {% set issue = [
      { num: "01", title: "Basketball", href: "/basketball/", dek: "Stats, schedule, film, and recruiting profiles." },
      { num: "02", title: "Football", href: "/football/", dek: "Multi-sport athlete. Versatile player with strong athleticism and game IQ." },
      { num: "03", title: "Academics", href: "/academics/", dek: "3.75 GPA (3.82 weighted). Coursework, JCCC, and a meteorology track." },
      { num: "04", title: "Projects & Passions", href: "/projects/", dek: "Off the floor: storms, film, and teaching the game." },
      { num: "05", title: "Character & Service", href: "/character/", dek: "Leadership, family, and showing up." },
      { num: "06", title: "Media & Photography", href: "/media/", dek: "Credentialed for Sporting KC. Sidelines for BVSW. @Shots_By_Franz." },
      { num: "07", title: "Updates", href: "/updates/", dek: "Game recaps, academic milestones, and what's on my mind." },
      { num: "08", title: "Timeline", href: "/timeline/", dek: "Seven years on the floor. School ball and AAU, season by season." },
      { num: "09", title: "Contact", href: "/contact/", dek: "Coaches, scouts, and media — reach the family directly." }
    ] %}
    {% for item in issue %}
      <a href="{{ item.href }}">
        <span class="cg-toc-num">{{ item.num }}</span>
        <span>
          <strong>{{ item.title }}</strong>
          <em>{{ item.dek }}</em>
        </span>
        <span class="cg-toc-go" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="cg-latest">
    <h3>Recent updates</h3>
    {% set recentUpdates = collections.updates | limit(3) %}
    {% for post in recentUpdates %}
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">
        <span class="cg-toc-num">{{ post.data.type or "Update" }}</span>
        <span>
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
          <strong>{{ post.data.title }}</strong>
          <span class="dek">{{ post.data.summary }}</span>
        </span>
        <span class="cg-toc-go" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cg-coaches" aria-label="For coaches">
  <div>
    <p class="cg-kicker">/ Contact</p>
    <h2>For<br>coaches.</h2>
    <p>Highlights, stats, and full recruiting profiles live on the Basketball page. For direct inquiries, reach the family below.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cg-coach-links">
    <a href="mailto:{{ player.parentEmail }}">
      <small>Email</small>
      <strong>{{ player.parentEmail }}</strong>
    </a>
    <a href="tel:{{ player.parentPhone }}">
      <small>Phone</small>
      <strong>{{ player.parentPhone }}</strong>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
